      "writtenOn": "2026-10-02T05:08:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I’m not sure whether bmcweb already has support for this. While sdbusplus performs code generation, it serves a different purpose. GraphQL schemas are fundamentally different and do not necessarily require automated code generation. What we are defining here is essentially a projection with an assigned name. GraphQL queries are then composed from these projection types and their members. There is no requirement to compile the schema into code; the schema can simply exist as a JSON file and be managed through normal Git-based revision control.",
      "parentUuid": "2bbb4f9b_8d39b866",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 289,
        "startChar": 39,
        "endLine": 289,
        "endChar": 78
