      "writtenOn": "2026-09-30T10:15:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The section about review focus can be deleted. It\u0027s not an issue to have separate maintainers working in the same repository but maintaining different applications and services. \n\nThis is already being done exactly that way in `libpldm` and `dbus-sensors` where some (sub) maintainers are focused on specific subfolders.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 291,
        "startChar": 77,
        "endLine": 294,
        "endChar": 50
      },
      "revId": "d288a7b4b79d2dc3b7811a39d885dd1f984d0da6",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
    {
